+From 761dabf8a5101f696c80923cba1a4a7090f12fcb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Emerald-dev0 <170873027+Emerald-dev0@users.noreply.github.com>
+Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 05:01:53 +0000
+Subject: [PATCH] feat: phases 0-6 + official SDK libraries (workspace recovery
+ squash)
+
+NOTE ON HISTORY: the session's earlier granular commits (b6a44b3 recovery
+squash 0-4, 114cc79 Phase 5, 1afb691 Phase 6, cf3e7d6+824f3d1 SDKs) were lost
+when the workspace object store was re-materialized from a file snapshot.
+This commit contains the full aggregate working-tree content of that work,
+re-verified before committing; phase-level detail lives in the repo docs
+(docs/ROADMAP.md status blocks, docs/PHASE6-RE-AUDIT.md, docs/DECISIONS.md
+ADR-039..042). Content is unchanged from what previously passed the gates.
+
+Aggregate scope:
+- Phases 0-5 (per ROADMAP): API/provider/worker substrate, auth basis,
+  plan/usage enforcement, Gmail+SES transports, webhook signing + deliver /
+  retries, domain verification, control-plane read pages, dashboards, docs
+  truth rewrite
+- Phase 6 (M6.1 security hardening, ADR-040): H4 OAuth link rule (unverified
+  provider email never auto-links; verified back-fills emailVerifiedAt),
+  DB lockout (failed_login_attempts/locked_until, pre-scrypt, exponential
+  to 30m, unit-tested), reset-revokes-all-sessions + lockout clear, session
+  inventory + revoke in settings (UA/IP/last-seen capture), OTP v2 peppered
+  HMAC bound to purpose+email with dual-accept window, bounded magic-link
+  consume, mandatory CRON_SECRET in production, Redis fixed-window limiter
+  with loud degraded-mode warn (ADR-041), migration 0022_auth_hardening
+- Phase 6 (M6.2 control truth pass): plan grants founder-only with audited
+  mandatory reason, role grants reason-prompted, audiences counted via
+  honest joins, settings presence checks read reality, abuse ladder restyled,
+  server-only guard for control queries, docs/PHASE6-RE-AUDIT.md sign-off
+- Production-essential SDKs (ADR-042): packages/sdk-node (14 tests green)
+  and sdks/python (16 pytest tests green) hand-rolled zero-dep clients with
+  identical contracts; sdks/ruby + sdks/php source-available beta; SDK hub
+  in dashboard updated with real tabs + honest publish status
+
+Gates at commit time: pnpm -r test = 242 passed, 0 failed (10 packages +
+worker/api/dashboard suites; integration suites skipped, Postgres down);
+dashboard production build clean; python SDK 16/16.
+
