++Idempotent by default; 5xx/429/network retry ONCE with jittered backoff; typed
++errors `Calder::AuthError` / `Calder::RateLimitError` (`retry_after_seconds`) /
++`Calder::RequestError` (`status`, `body`). Stdlib-only (net/http).
